OL,3,GNEWSANew Forest wildfire cost estimated
OL,4,Aat #600,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record-breaking wildfire in a
OL,7,Fnational park is estimated to have cost
OL,8,Fa fire service #600,000.
OL,10,FMore than 1 sq km (247 acres) of the
OL,11,FNew Forest was destroyed after the fire
OL,12,Fspread from a blazing van on 9 August.
OL,14,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,15,FRescue Authority said the incident was
OL,16,Fthe largest in the brigade's history.
OL,18,FChief financial officer Rob Sarfas told
OL,19,Fa fire authority meeting the blaze
OL,20,Frequired around 5,500 hours of
OL,21,Ffirefighter time.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
